  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target audience is individuals who are familiar with the Star Wars franchise and recognize Yoda as a wise, authoritative figure. The meme relies on this cultural reference to subvert Yoda's benevolent persona and amplify the impact of the abusive message. The intended audience likely includes internet users who understand meme culture and are capable of interpreting the juxtaposition of a beloved character with a cruel, dehumanizing statement. The meme is designed to be understood by those who can recognize the irony and the toxicity of the message, and who may be targeted by such content in online spaces.",
